                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wakuu wake huhukumu ili wapate rushwa, na makuhani wake hufundisha ili wapate ijara, na manabii wake hubashiri ili wapate fedha; ila hata hivyo watamtegemea BWANA, na kusema, Je! Hayupo BWANA katikati yetu? Hapana neno baya lolote litakalotufikia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
