                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi, kwa ajili yenu, Sayuni utalimwa kama shamba lilimwavyo, na Yerusalemu utakuwa magofu; na mlima wa nyumba utakuwa kama mahali palipoinuka msituni.",
          "type": "text",
